Z||000011||Fiero5||11-15-2001||11:38 AM||||"got a star trek bridge play set from the first movie at a yard sale $5!!!!!"<P>...and are you looking to keep it or sell it??<BR>Hmmm?<P>Anyone have any Star Trek memorabilia that they would like sell or trade?<BR>If I found someone with a large enough Star Trek collection and was interested, I would even consider trading one of my  Fieros for it.  Just a thought.<BR>If anyone is interested, I focus mostly on the original series and the movies with the TOS cast.<P>Steve<p>[This message has been edited by Fiero5 (edited 11-15-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000012||Ali_Gulf_Fiero||11-16-2001||10:41 AM||||Oh m'gosh! Fieros and Star trek. Two great tastes that taste great together! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>Being sensitive and musical, I liked TOS the best cause of the way they painted with lighting and the music. And the melodrama!<BR>My favorite episodes are:<BR>The Empath<BR>Is there in truth no beauty?<BR>Return to Tomorrow<BR>Assignment: Earth<P>I also love the TNG episode The Offspring<BR>Makes me cry...<BR>I'm enjoyin Enterprise so far. Dr Phlox is becoming a cool character.<BR>||||reg||1
